> It is a hot afternoon at the end of summer, and the {wheat} is ready for the {harvest}.
  look: wheat
  zh: 这是夏末一个炎热的下午，麦子熟了，等着收割。
> A {farmer} is still cutting it with a long {scythe}.
  look: farmer scythe
  zh: 一个农夫还在用长柄大镰刀割麦。
> The cut wheat is tied into {sheaves|sheaf} that stand like little tents.
  look: sheaf
  zh: 割下的麦子被捆成麦捆，像一顶顶小帐篷一样立着。
> Far away, past the {village} and the {church}, the {sea} shines under a pale {sky}.
  look: village church
  zh: 远处，越过村庄和教堂，大海在淡淡的天空下闪着光。
? lessonml:find three-jugs
  prompt: Someone hid drinks from the sun. Find all three jugs.
  targets: jug-1 jug-2 jug-3
  on correct: evidence recall jug

