> Under the {tree}, the workers stop for {lunch} in the {shade}.
  look: lunch tree
  zh: 树下，干活的人在阴凉处停下来吃午饭。
> There is {bread} from a {basket}, and porridge in wooden {bowls|bowl}.
  look: basket bowl
  zh: 有篮子里的面包，还有木碗里的粥。
> One man does not eat at all. He takes a {nap} against the tree {trunk}.
  look: nap trunk
  zh: 有个人什么都没吃，靠着树干睡起了午觉。
> A {boy} in white listens, and a man in a {straw hat|straw hat} laughs at a joke.
  look: boy hat
  zh: 一个穿白衣服的男孩在听，一个戴草帽的人被笑话逗乐了。
